OL,3,GNEWSABody found on French beach after
OL,4,Aattempted Channel crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has died following an
OL,7,Fattempted small boat crossing of the
OL,8,FEnglish channel, the French coastguard
OL,9,Fhas reported.
OL,11,FAuthorities said his body was found on
OL,12,FSainte-Cecile beach, near the coastal
OL,13,Ftown of Le Touquet, on Saturday
OL,14,Fmorning.
OL,16,FOvernight, a rescue team from France's
OL,17,FRegional Operational Center for
OL,18,FSurveillance (CROSS) had been deployed
OL,19,Fto monitor the boarding migrants onto a
OL,20,F"makeshift vessel" at the beach, it
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
