OL,3,GNEWSABody found on French beach after
OL,4,Aattempted Channel crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt reported that the vessel was stopped
OL,7,Ffrom departing by French authorities,
OL,8,Fand that no one was found in the water
OL,9,Ffollowing a "thorough sweep".
